logy\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive and Compassionate Care for Pittsburgh Pets Every Day of the Year\nMedVet Pittsburgh is home to advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in Pittsburgh, Allegheny County, and the surrounding communities. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian.\nServing more than 10,000 patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital 24 hours a day, 365 days a year – no appointment is needed.\nMedVet Pittsburgh Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nOur Hospital Leaders\nJamie Paglia, DVM\nMedical Director\nAshley Campa\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nChristine Anderson\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology), DACVR (Radiation Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nCaroline Bondi\n, BVM&S, Residency Trained in Internal Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nJocelyn Gilmore\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDenise Grohn\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAmber  Hutchinson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLancya Hutchison\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJacob Leslie\n, DVM, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nMorgan T. McGuire\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDanielle Micceri\n, DVM, DACVO®\nOphthalmology\nLeah Miller\n, DVM\nSurgery\nJamie Paglia\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine, Urgent Care\nGabby Schrader\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLynne Snow\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nAnne  Stoneham\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nCaroline Thompson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAngel Tumminello\n, DVM\nKatie Virostek\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nJessica Young\n, VMD, DACVR\nRadiology\nShow All Doctors (\n18\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nWe had a major emergency with our dog, Bonkers. We were taken right in, and my pet was cared for and comforted by everyone. The veterinarian’s expertise and how he explained every step was incredible. After surgery, Bonkers could stand and walk by the next day. This place is top-notch!.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
