      "address": "2810 Washington Rd., McMurray,  PA 15317",
      "description": "Comprehensive and Compassionate Care for Pittsburgh Pets Every Day of the Year  MedVet Pittsburgh is home to advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in Pittsburgh, Allegheny County, and the surrounding communities. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian.   Serving more than 10,000 patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome.   If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital 24 hours a day, 365 days a year – no appointment is needed.  ",
